      "problem_text": "解分式方程式$\\frac{x-3}{3x+1}=\\frac{x-3}{3x+2}$。",
      "problem_type": "textbook_example",
      "correct_answer": null,
      "detailed_solution": "方法一：通分母法$\\frac{x-3}{3x+1}=\\frac{x-3}{3x+2}$移項得$\\frac{x-3}{3x+1}-\\frac{x-3}{3x+2}=0$分母通分得$\\frac{\\left( x-3 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)}{\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)}-\\frac{\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( x-3 \\right)}{\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)}=0$合併兩分式得$\\frac{\\left( 3{{x}^{2}}-7x-6 \\right)-\\left( 3{{x}^{2}}-8x-3 \\right)}{\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)}=0$分子計算得$\\frac{x-3}{\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)}=0$，令x − 3 = 0得x = 3x = 3代回原式，知分母均不為0所以方程式的解為x = 3方法二：去分母法$\\frac{x-3}{3x+1}=\\frac{x-3}{3x+2}$依等量公理，等式兩邊同乘以$\\left( 3x+1 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)$得$\\left( x-3 \\right)\\left( 3x+2 \\right)=\\left( x-3 \\right)\\left( 3x+1 \\right)$移項得$\\left( x-3 \\right)\\left[ \\left( 3x+2 \\right)-\\left( 3x+1 \\right) \\right]=0$整併計算得x − 3 = 0，即x = 3x = 3代回原式，知分母均不為0所以方程式的解為x = 3",
      "difficulty_level": 1,
      "difficulty_h": 1.0,
      "notes": null
