      "detailed_solution": "$\\frac{2x-3}{x-1}-\\frac{x-1}{x+1}=\\frac{-2}{{{x}^{2}}-1}$依等量公理，等式兩邊同乘以$\\left( x-1 \\right)\\left( x+1 \\right)$去分母得$\\left( 2x-3 \\right)\\left( x+1 \\right)-{{\\left( x-1 \\right)}^{2}}=-2$左式展開得$\\left( 2{{x}^{2}}-x-3 \\right)-\\left( {{x}^{2}}-2x+1 \\right)=-2$整併計算得${{x}^{2}}+x-2=0$因式分解得$\\left( x+2 \\right)\\left( x-1 \\right)=0$解得x = −2或1但x = 1使原方程式分母為0，不合所以方程式的解為x = −2",
